{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/5476500b8d5614bc11e3b0fec3bc555a.avif?t=1752209873\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/0cf22a778e792d613f58d54a30f71d6f.poster.avif?t=1752209873\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/0cf22a778e792d613f58d54a30f71d6f.webp?t=1752209873\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cards to place or upgrade buildings and cast spells. Build your own custom deck and craft a unique defense strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/10b4e038b2ba658d4e566670a50b9be4.avif?t=1752209873\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/c017e8d8efadf76df098568863301f34.poster.avif?t=1752209873\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/c017e8d8efadf76df098568863301f34.webp?t=1752209873\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, the dark army swarms in. Your units and defense towers attack autonomously to protect the Goddess Statue. Choosing the right unit combos and upgrade effects is the key to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/d225a69f70360613372318aca03f802b.avif?t=1752209873\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/3d82f93b6f9bdcbccd1ae25fe79b43c1.poster.avif?t=1752209873\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/3d82f93b6f9bdcbccd1ae25fe79b43c1.webp?t=1752209873\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each goddess offers unique starting relics and deck, with more upgrades unlocked as she grows. After each successful defense, you'll earn new cards, relics, or encounter random events that send your fate in unexpected directions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/7c13c4cb535888a929d6d961b60445e1.avif?t=1752209873\" width=616 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/581fb34d42bdee56155f25c96e1c6945.poster.avif?t=1752209873\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/581fb34d42bdee56155f25c96e1c6945.webp?t=1752209873\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely combine cards, relics, and building upgrades to create a powerful line of defense. Protect the goddess and stand strong against the invading darkness!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183220?t=1752209873","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183220?t=1752209873","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as